WEBVTT

00:26.020 --> 00:28.020
Two RideBacks have fled the building.

00:28.110 --> 00:30.020
One rider is Rin Ogata, the wanted criminal.

00:30.110 --> 00:31.980
Grimoire Platoon is in pursuit.

00:36.740 --> 00:37.470
Bioform detected

00:36.970 --> 00:37.720
Firing restricted

00:38.100 --> 00:38.390
Firing permitted

00:42.500 --> 00:44.000
Damn!

00:45.370 --> 00:46.830
Tamayo!

00:49.380 --> 00:50.420
Ogata!

00:54.800 --> 00:55.840
She...!

00:57.220 --> 01:00.010
<i>Tamayo, please make it out safely!</i>

02:32.400 --> 02:35.190
I'm currently above the city of Shibakawa.

02:35.280 --> 02:40.820
Multiple large explosions occurred
inside the GGP military base here.

02:40.910 --> 02:44.660
Even from here we can see
lots of smoke rising into the air.

02:44.740 --> 02:48.040
The area near the scene appears to be in utter chaos.

02:48.120 --> 02:50.920
There are reports that this was
the work of the terrorist group, BMA.

02:51.000 --> 02:55.000
Efforts to confirm this are underway,
but as of now the details are unclear.

03:08.310 --> 03:12.810
<i>No one's riding them...</i>
<i>Are they RideBacks too, though?</i>

03:12.900 --> 03:14.690
<i>They're almost like insects...</i>

03:21.860 --> 03:26.530
<i>It's so light... I didn't know</i>
<i>the Fuego was this lightweight...</i>

03:26.620 --> 03:28.790
<i>I guess Fuegos really are...</i>

03:34.130 --> 03:36.790
Wanted vehicle is fleeing into the downtown area.

03:36.880 --> 03:40.300
Roger that.
Continue the Grimoire pursuit and catch her.

03:40.380 --> 03:42.340
All other squads, return to base immediately.

03:42.430 --> 03:44.140
We're attacking the terrorists on both flanks.

03:44.220 --> 03:45.180
Zero-one.

04:15.000 --> 04:17.960
That's impossible!
Anti-tank missiles don't work on them?!

04:27.850 --> 04:30.260
Don't let 'em scare you! Aim between their armor!

04:30.350 --> 04:32.180
They can be beaten at close range!

04:32.270 --> 04:36.650
Easy for you to say! You're not dealing with as many!

04:36.730 --> 04:38.810
Take out the guy controlling them!

04:38.900 --> 04:40.690
Firefight in front of Gate #3!

04:40.780 --> 04:44.450
Eight enemy RideBacks destroyed.
We've lost two Grimoires.

04:44.530 --> 04:46.320
We continue to hold the upper hand.

04:47.070 --> 04:48.870
Where is 2nd Company?!

04:48.950 --> 04:51.790
Seal the gates when they return!
Execute a pincer attack!

04:51.870 --> 04:55.710
Zero-one! Five minutes until they reach Gate #1.

04:55.790 --> 04:58.380
Enemy from the rear! They're cutting off our retreat!

04:58.460 --> 05:02.460
That's enough. You've caused
your trouble. No more pointless deaths!

05:02.550 --> 05:04.760
I guess you're right.

05:04.840 --> 05:06.300
All units, retreat!

05:06.390 --> 05:07.640
The enemy is pulling back.

05:07.720 --> 05:11.100
2nd Company has arrived. Now shutting gates.

05:11.180 --> 05:13.680
What an antisocial bunch.

05:13.770 --> 05:17.480
--Don't let even one escape!
--One enemy unit is heading this way!

05:17.560 --> 05:20.360
--It's a black RideBack!
--Put it on the screen!

05:22.360 --> 05:24.030
That saves us the trouble.

05:24.110 --> 05:26.740
Guttorm!
Never mind the rest; concentrate on him!

05:26.820 --> 05:27.780
Zero-one!

05:28.870 --> 05:32.330
I'll kill you in battle, just as you wish.

05:38.380 --> 05:42.170
<i>It's happening again.</i>
<i>I feel excited, despite the situation I'm in.</i>

05:47.220 --> 05:52.600
<i>It's just like before...</i>
<i>When I escaped with Shoko...</i>

05:55.480 --> 05:58.440
<i>I sensed a light amid</i>
<i>the bullet-filled smoke...</i>

05:58.520 --> 06:02.230
<i>As if it was driven by my pounding pulse...</i>

06:03.610 --> 06:07.530
<i>The light I saw on the Fuego... That sensation...</i>

06:07.610 --> 06:11.320
<i>The dazzling sight and racing heartbeat</i>

06:11.410 --> 06:13.120
<i>when machine and rider surpass their limits...</i>

06:13.200 --> 06:16.410
<i>You're bound by no one when you're on the Fuego.</i>

06:20.130 --> 06:24.710
<i>You changed your goal amid the blessed light.</i>

06:27.470 --> 06:31.930
<i>No. It isn't a blessed light at all.</i>

06:32.890 --> 06:33.930
She jumped?!

06:34.010 --> 06:37.220
Kawai! Kawai!

06:37.310 --> 06:39.140
Bad news! The TV!

06:39.230 --> 06:43.060
There is still no official
word from the police or the GGP,

06:43.150 --> 06:47.070
but this appears to be
Rin Ogata, the mysterious "RideBack girl"

06:47.150 --> 06:50.740
who played a part in
the series of BMA terrorist attacks.

06:50.820 --> 06:52.700
Additionally, the robots pursuing her...

06:52.780 --> 06:56.580
Rin... I thought you fled the country...?

06:56.660 --> 07:00.040
Details are unclear, however.

07:00.120 --> 07:03.290
We will continue with our breaking news coverage.

07:03.380 --> 07:05.840
The fires that broke out inside the GGP base...

07:09.170 --> 07:11.720
We're at Gate #1, currently locked in combat!

07:11.800 --> 07:14.760
They broke past 1st Platoon! Request backup!

07:20.640 --> 07:24.110
This is 2nd Company! They've broken through the gate!

07:24.190 --> 07:26.440
Many wounded in the explosions!

07:26.530 --> 07:28.940
Th-They're monsters!

07:30.950 --> 07:34.370
Grimoire Platoon is currently in pursuit of Rin Ogata.

07:34.450 --> 07:36.910
Target is heading toward the TV Tower.

07:45.250 --> 07:49.550
I've stopped the Grimoires.
This is where you will die.

07:52.720 --> 07:56.300
Target has entered a narrow alley!
Have two Grimoires cut her off!

07:57.310 --> 07:58.260
Ogata!

07:59.390 --> 08:04.230
Kawai and I are on our way!
Tell us where Rin is now!

08:04.310 --> 08:08.110
Umm... Near the arcade
in front of the station, I think...

08:08.900 --> 08:10.780
...is continuing to speed through the city.

08:10.860 --> 08:14.660
But is she simply trying to escape,
or is she headed somewhere in particular?

08:20.370 --> 08:24.790
<i>The Fuego responds to my movements.</i>

08:24.880 --> 08:30.000
<i>The light it shows me</i>
<i>is different from the light I sought.</i>

08:30.090 --> 08:36.260
<i>But I think I finally realize</i>
<i>why the Fuego captivated me</i>

08:36.340 --> 08:39.140
<i>and how to draw out the Fuego's true charm...</i>

09:00.830 --> 09:02.290
Fuego...

09:29.810 --> 09:34.240
I'm sorry! It's too much for me after all!

09:34.320 --> 09:38.110
I wasn't able to shine as brightly as Yuki Ogata!

09:39.870 --> 09:42.620
Our entire world...?

09:42.700 --> 09:47.330
Yes. For dancers, the stage is everything.

09:47.420 --> 09:50.130
It's where we're born and where we die.

09:50.210 --> 09:52.170
We're going to die?

09:54.130 --> 09:59.430
Even so, Rin, that life is reborn as "light."

09:59.510 --> 10:03.850
And the sparkle of life
intertwined with it will shine on everything.

10:03.930 --> 10:06.390
Sparkle of life...?

10:06.480 --> 10:09.440
I'm sure you'll understand someday.

10:09.520 --> 10:13.820
<i>Yes, the light does intertwine...</i>

10:13.900 --> 10:17.440
<i>Shoko's sparkle shined on me when I was down</i>

10:17.530 --> 10:21.320
<i>and my mother's sparkle</i>
<i>shined on everyone in the darkness...</i>

10:21.410 --> 10:25.490
<i>It's the same. Light... It's...</i>

10:30.670 --> 10:33.460
Target acquired. Civilian vehicle was damaged.

10:33.550 --> 10:35.420
There is a risk of fuel ignition.

10:47.430 --> 10:49.560
--Okakura?!
--Stay right where you are!

10:51.810 --> 10:54.020
Run for the Fuego on my signal!

10:54.110 --> 10:56.860
I absolutely have to know!

10:56.940 --> 11:02.410
Know what?! There's nothing
to learn from this ridiculous battle!

11:02.490 --> 11:03.120
Go!

11:06.790 --> 11:07.750
Ogata!

11:15.670 --> 11:17.460
<i>Let's go, Fuego.</i>

11:37.610 --> 11:39.780
<i>My lingering attachment...</i>

11:40.780 --> 11:42.200
This is Grimoire Platoon!

11:42.280 --> 11:46.120
Enemy launched a surprise attack.
Rin Ogata is again aboard a RideBack.

11:46.200 --> 11:48.370
Where did the man run to?!

11:48.450 --> 11:49.410
Freeze.

11:50.290 --> 11:52.330
Put your hands up and come out.

12:01.050 --> 12:02.720
Now I'll have payback.

12:02.800 --> 12:03.930
Are you so sure?

12:16.380 --> 12:16.460
Input disabled

12:19.690 --> 12:23.860
We've disabled Grimoire commands
from the compromised command vehicle!

12:23.950 --> 12:27.570
Grimoires are already executing shutdown orders.

12:27.660 --> 12:30.330
Get them all back online!

12:30.410 --> 12:32.500
Have all remaining units auto-pursue!

12:32.580 --> 12:35.290
Without the command vehicle,
they might go out of control...!

12:35.380 --> 12:38.380
I don't care! We can't let them make a mockery of us!

12:38.460 --> 12:41.800
--A message from HQ!
--What do they want at a time like this?!

12:49.970 --> 12:53.430
But we still haven't--! That's absurd!

12:53.520 --> 12:58.310
You're just going to shut it down?!
Then what was all my hard work for?!

13:06.360 --> 13:08.410
--Disarm.
--Sir?

13:08.490 --> 13:11.830
Are you deaf?! We have orders to disarm!

13:11.910 --> 13:16.790
Cease all fighting on the base. It's all over.

13:16.880 --> 13:19.460
Damn that woman!

13:19.540 --> 13:21.300
Four members of the Central Committee,

13:21.380 --> 13:25.670
the chief executive agency
of the GGP, have been replaced.

13:25.760 --> 13:28.220
It just hit the news. How are things there?

13:28.300 --> 13:29.800
Total chaos.

13:29.890 --> 13:33.680
Hesner probably never imagined
that the GGP would acknowledge

13:33.770 --> 13:36.810
a disclosure coming from the Japanese police.

13:36.900 --> 13:40.860
All the officials caught off guard
are being swarmed by the media.

13:40.940 --> 13:44.150
The big clean-up's about to begin.

13:44.240 --> 13:46.530
So, how is she?

13:46.610 --> 13:48.910
She's still on the run.

13:49.620 --> 13:52.330
Disarm? What's going on?!

13:52.410 --> 13:55.580
There've been helicopters all over-- Huh?

13:55.660 --> 13:57.250
Hey, you! Stop!

14:02.130 --> 14:03.300
What is this?!

14:03.380 --> 14:06.170
The robots believed to be new GGP
weapons are now attacking the police!

14:06.260 --> 14:08.300
Rin... Where are you going?

14:24.110 --> 14:27.400
That's the park where Suzuri died...

14:27.490 --> 14:30.490
What in the world are you doing, Rin?

14:39.620 --> 14:43.460
Please, Fuego. Lend me your help one more time.

14:43.550 --> 14:46.510
To intertwine the light...

14:46.590 --> 14:49.050
To cut my lingering attachment!

14:55.520 --> 14:58.390
Watch me, Suzuri...

15:27.710 --> 15:30.010
<i>This is my stage!</i>

15:30.090 --> 15:31.970
The RideBack girl is fighting!

15:32.050 --> 15:34.140
She's destroying one GGP robot after the next!

15:34.220 --> 15:38.180
--Oh, she's jumped again!
--No... She isn't fighting...

15:38.270 --> 15:39.850
She's trying to dance...

15:58.410 --> 16:00.330
My good old friend...

16:00.410 --> 16:05.380
No, my obedient soldier
who will sacrifice his life for me...

16:05.460 --> 16:07.960
Thank you for coming.

16:08.050 --> 16:12.880
Yes. I've come all the way from the abyss of Arizona.

16:53.800 --> 16:55.430
Oh, no...!

16:56.340 --> 16:58.510
No, Rin! Get out of there!

17:02.310 --> 17:05.310
Please, Fuego! Stand up!

17:05.400 --> 17:07.520
Stand up! Stand up, Fuego!

17:07.610 --> 17:13.570
Nothing's changed yet!
After all... I still haven't...!

17:32.000 --> 17:36.010
<i>The light... It hasn't gone yet?!</i>

17:36.090 --> 17:39.550
For dancers, the stage is everything.

17:40.510 --> 17:44.430
Just focus on dancing how your heart tells you to.

17:44.520 --> 17:47.100
The stage will answer back.

17:47.190 --> 17:50.560
Your heart is filled with light.

17:51.480 --> 17:53.570
As long as there's light in your heart,

17:53.650 --> 17:56.400
it will intertwine and allow you to dance.

17:56.490 --> 18:02.490
The stage is waiting for that. So enjoy dancing, Rin!

18:18.720 --> 18:21.260
Ideals... New order...

18:21.350 --> 18:23.680
The GGP has changed.

18:23.770 --> 18:27.560
We risked our lives in battle,
but apparently we're now obsolete junk.

18:27.640 --> 18:29.770
But none of that matters anymore.

18:29.850 --> 18:32.770
All I want now is to kill you.

18:32.860 --> 18:34.570
You can give your thanks in Hell.

19:04.810 --> 19:10.190
<i>The gravity-defying, time-stopping grand jete...</i>

19:13.560 --> 19:16.780
<i>A reverence...</i>
<i>The intertwining of the sparkle of life...</i>

19:16.860 --> 19:20.110
<i>And preparation for the coda...</i>

19:24.700 --> 19:29.500
<i>A miraculous, attention-grabbing jete entralace...</i>

19:32.000 --> 19:35.380
<i>You're showing this to Suzuri, aren't you, Rin...?</i>

19:44.850 --> 19:46.640
Unbelievable...

19:46.720 --> 19:47.600
Rin!

19:51.100 --> 19:52.100
Ogata...

20:11.410 --> 20:14.040
Thank you, Fuego...

20:59.170 --> 21:02.300
The GGP and Japanese government have just announced

21:02.380 --> 21:04.420
a new system of governance.

21:04.510 --> 21:09.100
At the conference,
the newly-reinstated Representative Nanpu Kataoka,

21:09.180 --> 21:12.350
stated the ruling party's goal for
a new constitution designed to cast off

21:12.430 --> 21:18.610
the old system and guarantee
a legislative body free from GGP involvement.

21:18.690 --> 21:23.740
As a result, all mandated
military forces will be withdrawn, and...

21:53.720 --> 21:55.140
I'm back.

21:56.730 --> 22:01.400
Even when he laughs

22:03.400 --> 22:08.990
I'm thinking of you before I realize it

22:12.030 --> 22:17.040
And the hands holding his

22:18.830 --> 22:24.300
feel your warmth, too

22:26.470 --> 22:30.220
Even if I cut out my recollections

22:30.300 --> 22:34.180
and drive them out of my heart

22:34.270 --> 22:37.930
or try to kick the memories out

22:38.020 --> 22:42.400
I still think of you

22:42.480 --> 22:46.900
Time now passes and seasons fly by

22:46.990 --> 22:50.740
Even if that smile starts to become hazy

22:50.820 --> 22:54.740
my heart will never forget you

22:54.830 --> 22:58.500
(even if we can never meet again)

22:58.580 --> 23:02.330
Even if I knock over photos of us smiling

23:02.420 --> 23:06.760
or try to hide my overflowing feelings

23:07.720 --> 23:10.970
my heart will never forget

23:11.680 --> 23:14.930
my memories with you
